    </row>
  </tbody>
</table>

<para>The function \(P\) gives the percent of voters ages 18 to 29 years old who participated in the election in year \(t\).</para>
<para>Determine the average rate of change for \(P\) between 1992 and 2000.</para>
<list>
  <item>1.025 percent per year</item>
  <item>-1.025 percent per year</item>
  <item>.4 percent per year</item>
  <item>-2.4 percent per year</item>
</list>
<para> <emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>–1.025 percent of voters per year </para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="13" type="enumerated">
  <item>Some points from a linear function, \(f(x)\), are listed in the table below. What is the rate of change of this linear function?</item>
</list>
<table class="os-raise-horizontaltable">
  <thead/>
  <tbody>
    <row>
      <entry scope="row" class="emphasis">
        \(x\)
      </entry>
      <entry>
        0
      </entry>
      <entry>
        5
      </entry>
      <entry>
        10
      </entry>
      <entry>
        15
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry scope="row" class="emphasis">
        \(f(x)\)
      </entry>
      <entry>
        4
      </entry>
      <entry>
        6
      </entry>
      <entry>
        8
      </entry>
      <entry>
        10
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody>
</table>

<list>
  <item>2</item>
  <item>\(\frac{2}{5}\)</item>
  <item>\(-\frac{2}{5}\)</item>
  <item>6</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(\frac25\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="14" type="enumerated">
  <item>Find the rate of change of the function, \(g(x)\), graphed below. <figure><media alt="GRAPH OF A LINE THAT PASSES THROUGH THE POINTS (0, 2) AND (1, −1)."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/eeb492073a46c47fa8ff97bc8dcae77a0740168a"/></media></figure></item>
</list>
<para> <emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> –3</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="15" type="enumerated">
  <item>What is the rate of change of the function \(h(x)= 4x -7\)? Enter your answer as an integer value.
    <emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>4</item>
</list></section>
